{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/sunvale-prysm-real-estate-al-furjan","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":1494,"crm_id":"8190","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":null,"title":"Sunvale","slug":"sunvale-prysm-real-estate-al-furjan","display_address":"Al Furjan","building_type":["apartment"],"completion_year":"2028 ","developer":"PRYSM Real Estate","price":1120000,"display_price":"1.12M","lattitude":24.942566598235,"longitude":55.215387054296,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":"1,2,2.5,3,3.5","about":"<p>Sunvale by PRYSM is a residential development in <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/al-furjan/\">Al Furjan</a>, one of Dubai's fastest-growing communities. The project is located close to <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/discovery-gardens/\">Discovery Gardens</a> and Al Furjan Metro Station. Sunvale Al Furjan offers <strong>1 to 3.5-bedroom apartments</strong> built for those who value comfort and connectivity in equal measure.</p><p>Residents can look forward to panoramic skyline views, a temperature-controlled pool with cold plunge and jacuzzi, a fully equipped gym, dedicated wellness spaces and areas for children and pets. Finished with premium materials and smart home automation throughout, Sunvale apartments present a strong option for buyers and investors looking for both lifestyle and long-term value in Dubai.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Feaure_image_8100884e7f.jpg","hash":"Feaure_image_8100884e7f","name":"Feaure image.jpg"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Banner_331aacd70c.jpg","hash":"Banner_331aacd70c","name":"Banner.jpg"},"media_images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentes