e Al Furjan Location - Close to Discovery Gardens and Al Furjan Metro Station, with quick access to Dubai Marina, JLT and Sheikh Zayed Road.</li><li>Choice of Residences - Spacious 1, 2, 2.5, 3 and 3.5-bedroom apartments suited to individuals, couples and families.</li><li>Resort-Style Amenities - A temperature-controlled pool with cold plunge and jacuzzi, a fully equipped gym, yoga studio and Pilates lounge.</li><li>Wellness-Focused Living - A dedicated wellness center with spa, steam and sauna rooms supports a balanced, everyday lifestyle.</li><li>Developed by PRYSM with GRID - Built in partnership with GRID as Development Lifecycle Management partner, bringing precision and market insight to every stage of the project.</li><li>Family and Pet-Friendly Design - Kids' splash areas, outdoor play spaces and pet-friendly walking tracks cater to residents of every age.</li><li>Panoramic Skyline Views - Private balconies frame views over Dubai's evolving skyline.</li><li>Smart, Connected Homes - Home automation for lights and air conditioning, plus EV chargers for select parking, add everyday convenience.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":2229,"cta":{"id":3062,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#payment-plans"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Map_3fde7bdfee.jpg","hash":"Map_3fde7bdfee","name":"Map.jpg"},"style":null,"title":null,"heading":"Location","bg_color":"blue","add_place":[{"id":148,"place_name":"Dubai Marina","time_distance":"12 minutes"},{"id":149,"place_name":"JLT","time_distance":"15 minutes"},{"id":150,"place_name":"Mall of the Emirates","time_distance":"20 minutes "},{"id":151,"place_name":"Expo City","time_distance":"20 minutes"},{"id":152,"place_name":"Museum of the Future","time_distance":"25 minutes"},{"id":153,"place_name":"Burj Al Arab","time_distance":"25 minutes"}],"image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[]